SUMMARY:Part Closure: HAMMERSMITH & CITY LINE: Saturday 28 and Sunday 29 
 November\, no service on the entire line. There will also be no CIRCLE 
 LINE service between Hammersmith / High Street Kensington and Tower Hill 
 (via Kings Cross St Pancras). Use DISTRICT LINE services between Aldgate 
 East and Barking.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261128T133518Z
