BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261128T133518Z
UID:c9cc7b27-eb1f-11f1-8000-70a8a527d0f0
DTSTART:20261122
DTEND:20270221
SUMMARY:Interchange Message: LIVERPOOL STREET NATIONAL RAIL STATION: From 
 Sunday 22 November until mid-February the lift between the NR concourse 
 and Tube ticket hall (for step-free access to the Elizabeth line and the 
 eastbound Circle and Hammersmith & City lines) will be out of service for 
 replacement work. For step-free access to enter Liverpool Street\, an 
 alternative lift is available in the Broadgate shops which will take you 
 to street level and step-free entry to the station is available via the 
 Broadgate entrance
END:VEVENT
